### Add student 1: Only a few details
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rahul",
  "rollNumber": 101,
  "class": 12
}

### Add student 2: Completely different details
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Priya",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "address": "Noida",
  "hobby": "Cricket",
  "bloodGroup": "B+",
  "scholarship": true,
  "subjects": ["Maths", "Physics", "Chemistry"]
}

### Add student 3: Include nested details
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aman",
  "department": "Computer Science",
  "guardian": {
    "name": "Rajesh",
    "phone": "9876501234"
  }
}

### Get all students
GET http://localhost:8080/students

### Get student with ID 1
GET http://localhost:8080/students/1

### Add or change fields for student 1
PATCH http://localhost:8080/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "9999999999",
  "address": "Greater Noida",
  "bloodGroup": "O+"
}

### Delete student 1
DELETE http://localhost:8080/students/1